   <text:p text:style-name="Text_20_body"><text:soft-page-break/>The next <text:span text:style-name="T372">system</text:span> model places the injector at the center of the <text:span text:style-name="T372">cluster</text:span>, where it broadcasts the hail and also routes the salutations to the extractor.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="Text_20_body"/>
