      <text:p text:style-name="P55">Figure <text:sequence text:ref-name="refFigure12" text:name="Figure" text:formula="ooow:Figure+1" style:num-format="1">13</text:sequence>: WorldHello Alternate <text:span text:style-name="T372">System</text:span> Model</text:p>
     </draw:text-box>
    </draw:frame><text:line-break/>Yet another <text:span text:style-name="T372">system</text:span> model places the extractor at the center of the <text:span text:style-name="T372">cluster</text:span>, where it routes the hail and waits for salutations.</text:p>
